{"seq":3,"slug":"viscosity-and-turbulence","title":"黏性与湍流","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/mechanics/fluid-mechanics/viscosity-and-turbulence","wordCount":1310,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"黏性与湍流\">黏性与湍流</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>前两篇把流体理想化了。真实流体有黏性，会消耗能量；流速一高，平顺的流动会崩溃成混乱的湍流。这一篇直面这些&quot;不理想&quot;。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>黏性</strong>：流体抵抗剪切变形的性质。牛顿黏性定律 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>μ</mi><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau = \\mu \\dfrac{dv}{dy}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2519em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 是动力黏度，描述相邻流层间的剪切应力。</li>\n<li><strong>层流与湍流</strong>：层流是流体分层平稳流动；湍流是充满漩涡的混乱流动。</li>\n<li><strong>雷诺数</strong>：判别流态的无量纲数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow><mi>μ</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Re = \\dfrac{\\rho v L}{\\mu}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2408em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Re</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span> 小则黏性主导（层流），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Re</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span> 大则惯性主导（湍流）。</li>\n<li><strong>沿程损失</strong>：黏性使流体在管道中流动时压强不断下降，需要泵或落差来补偿。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><p>黏性是流体&quot;内摩擦&quot;的来源。把流体想象成一叠扑克牌，你推最上面一张，下面的牌会被带着动但越往下越慢——相邻流层之间有&quot;拖拽&quot;，这就是黏性。蜂蜜黏度大（流层间拖拽强、流得慢），水黏度小，空气更小。黏性定律 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>μ</mi><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau = \\mu \\dfrac{dv}{dy}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2519em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 说：流速在垂直方向变化越剧烈（速度梯度越大），剪切应力越大。</p>\n<p>黏性带来一个重要后果——<strong>沿程损失</strong>。伯努利方程说理想流体压强守恒，但真实管道里，黏性不断把机械能耗散成热，所以压强沿程下降。这就是为什么远距离输水、输油要中途加压站，也是水龙头开很久水温会微升的原因之一。</p>\n<p>这一篇的核心是<strong>层流到湍流的转变</strong>，而判别它的钥匙是雷诺数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Re</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span>。我觉得雷诺数是流体力学里最优美的概念之一：它把密度、流速、尺寸、黏度四个量打包成一个无量纲数，用来比较&quot;惯性&quot;和&quot;黏性&quot;谁占上风：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow><mi>μ</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>惯性力</mtext><mtext>黏性力</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Re = \\frac{\\rho v L}{\\mu} = \\frac{\\text{惯性力}}{\\text{黏性力}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2408em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">黏性力</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">惯性力</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Re</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span> 小（黏性主导）：流体&quot;听话&quot;，分层平稳流动——<strong>层流</strong>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Re</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span> 大（惯性主导）：黏性压不住扰动，流动崩溃成漩涡——<strong>湍流</strong>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>对圆管内流动，经验上 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>2300</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Re &lt; 2300</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2300</span></span></span></span></span> 为层流，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>4000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Re &gt; 4000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4000</span></span></span></span></span> 为湍流，中间是过渡区。这个临界值是雷诺在 1883 年用染色水实验测出来的，至今仍是教科书标准。</p>\n<p>层流和湍流的对比非常鲜明：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>层流</th>\n<th>湍流</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>流动形态</td>\n<td>分层平稳，流线清晰</td>\n<td>充满漩涡，混乱无序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>雷诺数</td>\n<td>低（圆管 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>2300</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt;2300</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2300</span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n<td>高（圆管 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>4000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;4000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4000</span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>速度分布</td>\n<td>抛物线，中心快边缘慢</td>\n<td>较平坦，近壁陡变</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>能量损耗</td>\n<td>较小</td>\n<td>较大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合能力</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>强（利于换热、燃烧）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>有趣的是，湍流并非总是坏事。它的强混合能力对换热器、燃烧室、化学反应器反而有利;而要减阻(如输油管道、游泳、飞行)就希望维持层流或抑制湍流。工程上常常是&quot;该湍则湍、该层则层&quot;地主动调控。</p>\n<p>流态判别的决策可以画成:</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[计算雷诺数 Re=ρvL/μ] --&gt; B{Re 大小?}&#10;    B --&gt;|Re 小 黏性主导| C[层流 平稳分层]&#10;    B --&gt;|Re 大 惯性主导| D[湍流 漩涡混乱]&#10;    C --&gt; E[沿程损失小 流线可预测]&#10;    D --&gt; F[沿程损失大 混合强 难以解析]\">flowchart TD\n    A[计算雷诺数 Re=ρvL/μ] --&gt; B{Re 大小?}\n    B --&gt;|Re 小 黏性主导| C[层流 平稳分层]\n    B --&gt;|Re 大 惯性主导| D[湍流 漩涡混乱]\n    C --&gt; E[沿程损失小 流线可预测]\n    D --&gt; F[沿程损失大 混合强 难以解析]</pre><h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>水(<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1000</mn><msup><mtext> kg/m</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho=1000\\text{ kg/m}^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.204em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> kg/m</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.954em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>,<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.0</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mtext> Pa⋅s</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu=1.0\\times10^{-3}\\text{ Pa·s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> Pa⋅s</span></span></span></span></span></span>)在直径 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.02</mn><mtext> m</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.02\\text{ m}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.02</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> m</span></span></span></span></span></span> 的管中以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.5</mn><mtext> m/s</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.5\\text{ m/s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> m/s</span></span></span></span></span></span> 流动。求雷诺数，判断是层流还是湍流。</li>\n<li>同样的流速和管径，换成蜂蜜(<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 大几千倍),雷诺数会怎么变?流态更可能是层流还是湍流?这解释了什么生活现象?</li>\n<li>思考:为什么飞机设计师想尽办法让机翼表面保持层流(减阻),而锅炉换热管却故意制造湍流(增强换热)?同一个湍流，为何评价相反?</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><p>湍流被称为&quot;经典物理学最后的未解难题&quot;。它的控制方程(纳维—斯托克斯)早已写出，但湍流的混沌、多尺度特性让解析求解几乎不可能。物理学家费曼曾称它是&quot;经典物理中最重要的未解问题&quot;。</p>\n<p>工程上对付湍流靠两条路:一是实验(风洞、水槽);二是数值模拟。计算流体力学(CFD)中，直接数值模拟(DNS)能解析所有湍流尺度但耗算力极大，只能用于小问题;工程中更常用雷诺平均(RANS)和大涡模拟(LES)等模型化方法，在精度和算力间折中。截至 2026 年，结合机器学习的湍流建模(用神经网络替代经验湍流模型)是流体力学最热的研究前沿之一，试图让 CFD 又快又准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>黏性是流体内摩擦，导致真实管流的沿程压强损失(伯努利不再严格成立)。</li>\n<li>雷诺数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Re</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span> 是惯性与黏性之比，是判别层流/湍流的关键无量纲数。</li>\n<li>层流平稳、损耗小但混合弱;湍流混乱、损耗大但混合强——按需调控。</li>\n<li>湍流至今无完整解析理论，工程靠实验 + CFD,前沿是机器学习辅助建模。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>流体力学到此告一段落。下一章我们用&quot;振动&quot;和&quot;波&quot;把固体与流体统一起来，看能量如何在介质中往复与传播。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"黏性与湍流","id":"黏性与湍流"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"伯努利方程与流动","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/mechanics/fluid-mechanics/bernoulli-and-flow"},"next":{"title":"自由振动与受迫振动","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/mechanics/vibration-and-continua/free-and-forced-vibration"}}